<title>USA: TABLE - U.S. GDP annual revisions 1994-1996.</title>
<headline>TABLE - U.S. GDP annual revisions 1994-1996.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commerce Department Thursday released annual revisions to U.S. real Gross Domestic Product in seasonally adjusted annual rates.</p>
<p>    -			     1996   1995   1994</p>
<p>    Revised -- Real GDP	2.8    2.0    3.5</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Real GDP	2.4    2.0    3.5</p>
<p>    Revised -- Price Index   2.3    2.5    2.4</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Price Index   2.1    2.5    2.3</p>
<p>QUARTER-TO-QUARTER PERCENT CHANGES:</p>
<p>    -1996			   Q4     Q3     Q2     Q1</p>
<p>    Revised -- Real GDP	4.3    1.0    6.0    1.8</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Real GDP	3.8    2.1    4.7    2.0</p>
<p>    Revised -- Price Index   1.9    2.7    1.9    2.8</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Price Index   1.9    2.0    2.2    2.3</p>
<p>    -1995			   Q4     Q3     Q2     Q1</p>
<p>    Revised -- Real GDP	2.2    3.0    0.3    0.9</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Real GDP	0.3    3.8    0.7    0.4</p>
<p>    Revised -- Price Index   2.1    2.0    2.1    3.3</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Price Index   2.1    2.1    2.4    3.3</p>
<p>    -1994			   Q4     Q3     Q2     Q1</p>
<p>    Revised -- Real GDP	3.6    1.8    4.7    3.0</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Real GDP	2.9    3.5    4.9    2.5</p>
<p>    Revised -- Price Index   2.6    2.5    2.2    2.5</p>
<p> Prev. Est. -- Price Index   2.1    2.4    1.9    2.9</p>
</text>
